/// Tenancy agreements (leases) linking properties to tenants; grain is one row per tenancy (18,002 rows, one per Property Tenancy ID). Holds each tenancy's lifecycle dates, bond, rent and compliance details. Contains the current warehouse SCD version only (DWH Is Current = 1) and EXCLUDES Cancelled tenancies (partition filter); it RETAINS historical/closed tenancies (Vacated, Vacated Closed Account, etc.) — 'current' means the latest DWH version, not only active tenancies. A property can have multiple tenancies over time. Adds SQL-derived stay-chain columns (Prev Vacate Date, Gap Days, Is New Chain, Chain ID, Chain Start Date) and referral-match calculated columns.
table Tenancy
